  ok   a ghosted grade that is hidden is not ghosted
  ok   a mesh added later with a patched material is reached when the object list is next rebuilt
  ok   a geometry whose page arrays were freed is read from the range kept for it, or drawn in both passes
  ok   when the ghosting ends, the next frame takes the ghost layer off everything it was put on
  ok   under setGhostAsDither, a named layer ghosts as a dither in the opaque pass and never enters the ghost pass
  ok   disposing a material disposes its twin

